(** What Soma takes add.wasm, next to this file, to be: built from rust/
    (rust/build.sh), it exports add and fib, of i64s. Here they are of
    whole numbers, N: each call checks it, and a number the module gives
    that an N cannot hold, a negative one, is a run-time error that says
    so. *)

add : N -> N -> N.
fib : N -> N.
